+## Authentication
+
+`POST /api/v1/auth/login` with a JSON body of `username` and `password`
+and an `X-Api-Key` header. Returns a JWT bearer token.
+
+To call the login handler directly from Python:
+
+```python
+from app.api.authentication import login
+```
+
 ## Running tests
 
 ```bash
